; TORRE HUNDIDA sprites, 8x16 mode (LCDC.2 = 1): each sprite = 2 tiles, top at an even
; index, bottom next. Multi-sprite objects are row-major: NAME + 2*k is sprite k
; (k = row * sprites_per_row + col). No white: color 0 is transparent, OBP0 0xE4.
; Big monsters carry a 1 px light-gray halo so they read over the black darkness.

